    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72466" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴνη</span></b>  (A) (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος</span>), ἡ, old name for <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the vine,</i>
